According to a new study conducted recently it has come to the fore that the men who have sex at least twice a week , the danger of heart - related diseases becomes almost half in them .
According to this those men who have intercourse regularly , the chances of diseases related to the heart in them reduces by up to 45 percent in comparison to those who have sex once in a month or less than that .
In this study 1 ,000 men were included and it was found that sex gives protective base to the heart of men .
